warning: grund.toml:8: [schema.sources.extensions] maps `md` to `rust`, which does not read Markdown; `.md` is always Markdown, and until then a `.md` file is read as `rust`; drop the entry, or map `md` to a `document` language; this becomes an error in grund 1.0.0
warning: grund.toml:15: [schema.kinds.RULE] files entry `rules/rules.md` is read as `rust`, which does not read Markdown, and every home of a rule kind must be; until then a rule written as a Markdown heading there declares nothing; move the rules into a file a `document` language reads; this becomes an error in grund 1.0.0
